## Read the gate guide

Open the two headings and read how the gate works. You can return to this guide during a shift.

### Normal level
as: accordion

At the normal river level, the gate stays open and water moves through the channel.

### High level

At the high river level, the operator closes the gate and checks the upstream gauge.

close: accordion

